{"availability":"available","full":"Omega-Mu-Gamma-Studio/Kotlin-Chan","name":"Kotlin-Chan","description":"Kotlin-chan is an interactive, browser-based learning platform where a sleek anime mascot teaches modern Android development through 75 lessons, a \"See It Work → Break → Try\" methodology, and a progression system with unlockable outfits and themes.","category":"Education","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-29T12:35:56Z","updated":"2026-07-04T13:20:47Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://kotlin-chan.vercel.app","topics":["android-development","anime","character-driven","framer-motion","gamification","interactive-learning","jetpack-compose","kotlin","leveling","react","tutorial","vercel","vite","xp-system","zustand"],"demo":"https://kotlin-chan.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:32.845Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:32.845Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:32.845Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:32.845Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An anime-guided Kotlin and Jetpack Compose tutor for people building the app that's actually going on the Play Store. Sleek. Modern. Null-safe. She doesn't do clutter. []( []( []( []( [](./LICENSE) [](","Built by Omega Mu Gamma Studio · the team behind SeeDS, KMapX, EG Suite, GateLab, Java-chan, and Kotlin-chan.","Kotlin-chan is a browser-based Kotlin and Android learning app where a sleek, modernist mascot character teaches mobile development with a clean, no-nonsense polish — the kind of design sense you'd expect from someone who's spent real time in Material 3. She doesn't lecture. She demonstrates, cleanly, then lets the code speak."],"features":["Three-phase lesson structure — See It Work → See It Break → You Try, on every lesson, no exceptions","Android-app context throughout — every Composable and class is part of one growing app","Contextual hint escal